Module « Animations » (coupole/modules/anim)
--------------------------------------------
Les animations de ce module sont refaites en Python d'après ClassAction, University of Nebraska-Lincoln Astronomy
Education, Apache License 2.0 (texte complet : LICENCES/Apache-2.0.txt).
The animations of this module are remade in Python after ClassAction, University of Nebraska-Lincoln Astronomy
Education, Apache License 2.0 (full text: LICENCES/Apache-2.0.txt).

